# Step 6 - cache-service
# Preload the cache so the AFTER reads are served from L1/L2.
# (This warmup does the DB work once, up front; we reset the counters after it
# in step 7 so the AFTER measurement reflects only the cached read traffic.)

@cache = http://localhost:8086

### Warm up the cache
POST {{cache}}/api/cache/warmup

# Expected: 200 OK
